 "sentences": [
  "Nashville hides Tennessee's most visited state park.",
  "Bicentennial Capitol Mall sits on 19 acres downtown.",
  "It functions as an outdoor museum showcasing Tennessee history.",
  "The site incorporates Classical Greek, Baroque, and Beaux-Arts architecture.",
  "Native Tennessee plants landscape the park.",
  "Over 2.5 million people visit this popular public space annually.",
  "It even sits on land once used by Native Americans for hunting."
